{"dur": 92.51245833333331, "lines": [{"id": "a1", "text": "In this town, jumping is illegal.", "start": 0.4, "end": 1.7007083333333335}, {"id": "a2", "text": "Like... actually illegal.", "start": 2.050708333333333, "end": 3.0457083333333332}, {"id": "a3", "text": "Our mayor says jumping is disrespectful to the ground.", "start": 3.445708333333333, "end": 5.671791666666667}, {"id": "a4", "text": "And the ground has done nothing wrong.", "start": 5.921791666666667, "end": 7.133583333333333}, {"id": "a5", "text": "So everybody here just... walks. Every day. Forever.", "start": 7.633583333333333, "end": 9.857583333333334}, {"id": "a6", "text": "Dave walks to work. Linda walks to the bakery.", "start": 10.207583333333334, "end": 12.096875}, {"id": "a7", "text": "Nobody ever jumps. Not even on their birthday.", "start": 12.346875, "end": 14.157333333333334}, {"id": "a7b", "text": "We have trampolines, but they're just for decoration.", "start": 14.657333333333334, "end": 16.645166666666668}, {"id": "a7c", "text": "Our basketball team has never scored a single point. Ever.", "start": 16.995166666666666, "end": 19.48725}, {"id": "a7d", "text": "And if you trip, and both your feet leave the ground at the same time? That counts. You go to jail.", "start": 19.83725, "end": 23.754833333333334}, {"id": "a8", "text": "But me? I'm built different.", "start": 24.354833333333335, "end": 25.37454166666667}, {"id": "a8b", "text": "I moved here last week. Nobody told me the rules.", "start": 25.974541666666667, "end": 28.051125}, {"id": "b1", "text": "So today I'm walking home, and I see... a puddle.", "start": 28.551125, "end": 30.53775}, {"id": "b2", "text": "And I'm like... what if.", "start": 30.937749999999998, "end": 31.821666666666665}, {"id": "b3", "text": "So I jumped.", "start": 32.321666666666665, "end": 32.9265}, {"id": "b4", "text": "The whole town gasped.", "start": 34.1265, "end": 34.988458333333334}, {"id": "b5", "text": "Linda dropped her bread.", "start": 35.28845833333333, "end": 36.14875}, {"id": "b6", "text": "Dave said, the bread knows. I still don't know what that means.", "start": 36.49875, "end": 38.81645833333334}, {"id": "b6b", "text": "A baby started crying. A dog fainted. A man fell off his bike, but very slowly, so it was legal.", "start": 39.216458333333335, "end": 43.8175}, {"id": "c1", "text": "Then the mayor showed up. And he was mad.", "start": 44.3175, "end": 45.844875}, {"id": "c2", "text": "He was like, young man, do you know what you've done?", "start": 46.244875, "end": 47.825375}, {"id": "c3", "text": "And I was like, moved my legs... upward?", "start": 48.125375, "end": 49.64091666666666}, {"id": "c4", "text": "He said, we don't say that word here.", "start": 50.04091666666667, "end": 51.246208333333335}, {"id": "c5", "text": "So I asked him why nobody can jump.", "start": 51.646208333333334, "end": 53.15141666666667}, {"id": "c6", "text": "And he told me that forty years ago, he tried to jump... but his hat was too heavy.", "start": 53.45141666666667, "end": 56.88529166666667}, {"id": "c7", "text": "So he banned it. For everyone. Forever.", "start": 57.185291666666664, "end": 58.646249999999995}, {"id": "c8", "text": "Bro.", "start": 59.34625, "end": 59.729124999999996}, {"id": "c8b", "text": "Like... that is the dumbest thing I have ever heard in my life.", "start": 60.629124999999995, "end": 62.87604166666666}, {"id": "d1", "text": "So I jumped again.", "start": 63.47604166666666, "end": 64.20079166666666}, {"id": "d2", "text": "And then Dave jumped.", "start": 64.70079166666666, "end": 65.49429166666665}, {"id": "d3", "text": "Then Linda jumped.", "start": 65.74429166666665, "end": 66.47449999999999}, {"id": "d4", "text": "Then everybody jumped!", "start": 66.72449999999999, "end": 67.607125}, {"id": "d4b", "text": "Grandmas were jumping. Babies were jumping. Even the dog woke up and jumped.", "start": 68.407125, "end": 71.64083333333333}, {"id": "e1", "text": "The mayor got so mad, he took off his hat and said, fine, I'll do it myself.", "start": 72.24083333333333, "end": 75.46429166666667}, {"id": "e2", "text": "And he jumped.", "start": 75.86429166666666, "end": 76.477875}, {"id": "e3", "text": "He never came down.", "start": 78.07787499999999, "end": 78.891375}, {"id": "e3b", "text": "Some people say he's still going up.", "start": 79.79137499999999, "end": 81.14233333333333}, {"id": "e4", "text": "So now I'm the mayor.", "start": 81.94233333333332, "end": 82.67495833333332}, {"id": "e5", "text": "And in this town, we only have one law.", "start": 83.07495833333333, "end": 84.48929166666666}, {"id": "e6", "text": "No hats.", "start": 84.98929166666666, "end": 85.55083333333333}, {"id": "e7", "text": "Wait.", "start": 88.15083333333332, "end": 88.54120833333333}, {"id": "e8", "text": "Oh no.", "start": 89.74120833333332, "end": 90.21245833333332}], "sfx": [{"t": 0.4, "name": "music"}, {"t": 32.8765, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 32.8765, "name": "musicstop"}, {"t": 34.1265, "name": "gasp"}, {"t": 35.94875, "name": "thunk"}, {"t": 44.3175, "name": "siren"}, {"t": 64.15079166666666, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 64.15079166666666, "name": "music"}, {"t": 65.34429166666665, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 66.32449999999999, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 67.1245, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 67.507125, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 67.6245, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 68.1245, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 68.70712499999999, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 69.607125, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 70.607125, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 72.24083333333333, "name": "musicstop"}, {"t": 76.06429166666666, "name": "whoosh"}, {"t": 76.427875, "name": "bigboing"}, {"t": 81.94233333333332, "name": "music"}, {"t": 85.48929166666666, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 85.88929166666667, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 86.28929166666666, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 86.68929166666666, "name": "boing"}, {"t": 88.15083333333332, "name": "musicstop"}, {"t": 88.15083333333332, "name": "scratch"}, {"t": 89.94120833333332, "name": "sting"}]}